  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Workplace Protection and Social Services for Migrant Laborers in the Urban Construction Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant assists the Ministry of Construction in strengthening legal rights and working conditions for migrant workers employed in urban construction. The grant also includes support for training and capacity-building within the Ministry of Construction . The Ministry of Construction (MOC) to promote protection of workers&apos; rights and provision of adequate social services on behalf of migrant laborers, and to strengthen MOC&apos;s own urban construction management and monitoring capacity. In addition to improving the living and working conditions of migrants in urban construction, this program also would contribute to the kinds of administrative and regulatory reform essential to effective governance in a market economy.</narrative>
  </description>
